    "probe_text": "Here is the complete, ordered list of everything applied when creating an owner via `POST /api/owners`. The path is: framework-level checks \u2192 then the controller method `OwnerRestControllerV1.addOwner`.\n\n## Phase 0 \u2014 Before the controller body runs (framework)\n\n1. **Authorization** \u2014 `@PreAuthorize(\"hasRole(@roles.OWNER_ADMIN)\")` requires the `ROLE_OWNER_ADMIN` authority (403 otherwise). *Caveat: only enforced when `petclinic.security.enable=true`; `@EnableMethodSecurity` lives only on the enabled security config, so with security disabled this check is silently skipped.*\n2. **Bean Validation on the request DTO** \u2014 `OwnerFieldsDto` is `@Valid @RequestBody` on the `@Validated` `OwnersApi` interface. Enforced before the method body; failures \u2192 `MethodArgumentNotValidException` \u2192 400. Constraints:\n   - `firstName` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1..30)`, `@Pattern` (letters, up to 3 words, `' -` separators)\n   - `lastName` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1..30)`, `@Pattern` (same, optional trailing `.`)\n   - `address` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1..255)`\n   - `city` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1..80)`\n   - `telephone` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1..20)`\n   - `email` \u2014 `@Size(1..255)`, `@Email` (optional)\n   - `postcode` \u2014 `@Pattern(\"^[0-9]{4}$\")` (optional)\n\n## Phase 1 \u2014 Inside `addOwner` (in exact source order)\n\n3. **Normalize address** (side-effect, mutates DTO) \u2014 trim, collapse whitespace, upper-case, expand `ST\u2192STREET`, `RD\u2192ROAD`, `AVE\u2192AVENUE`.\n4. **`validateRequiredFields`** \u2014 reject if firstName/lastName/address/city/telephone blank \u2192 `RequiredFieldsMissingException` (400). *Runs after normalization, so a whitespace-only address becomes `\"\"` and is caught here.*\n5. **Default registrationDate** (side-effect) \u2014 if null, set to `LocalDate.now()` (today = 2026-08-11).\n6. **`toBusinessDay`** (side-effect, mutates DTO) \u2014 roll Saturday/Sunday forward to Monday.\n7. **`rejectDailyOwnerLimit`** \u2014 reject if \u2265100 existing owners already have that registrationDate \u2192 `DailyOwnerLimitExceededException` (429).\n8. **`rejectCityAtCapacity`** \u2014 reject if the city already holds \u226550 owners (`CITY_CAPACITY=50`) \u2192 `CityAtCapacityException` (409).\n9. **`validatePostcode`** \u2014 if postcode present, require 4 digits within the city's region range (NSW 2000\u20132099, VIC 3000\u20133099, QLD 4000\u20134099) \u2192 `InvalidPostcodeException` (400).\n10. **`normalizeTelephone`** (side-effect, mutates DTO) \u2014 convert to E.164 (default `+61`, strip leading 0), require 8\u201315 digits and correct national length \u2192 `InvalidTelephoneException` (400).\n11. **`normalizeEmail`** (side-effect, mutates DTO) \u2014 blank \u2192 null; otherwise must match email pattern, stored lower-cased \u2192 `InvalidEmailException` (400).\n12. **Derive householdId** \u2014 only if `sharesHousehold == true`: `HH-<12 hex>` from SHA-256 of normalized lastName + address; else null.\n13. **`rejectDuplicateIdentity`** \u2014 build identity key `telephone|email|householdId` and reject if it matches any existing owner \u2192 `DuplicateIdentityException` (409).\n14. **Map DTO \u2192 `Owner` entity** (`ownerMapper.toOwner`).\n15. **Set derived entity fields** (side-effects, computed by scanning all owners):\n    - `customerCode` = `<CITY3>-<LAST3>-<NNNN>` (per-city sequence)\n    - `householdId` (from step 12)\n    - `householdSize`\n    - `namesakeCount` (same first+last name)\n    - `bulkSignupWarning` (true if >80 owners same registrationDate)\n16. **`clinicService.saveOwner(owner)`** \u2014 `@Transactional`, delegates to `ownerRepository.save`. Persists the owner (and cascades to `pets`, `CascadeType.ALL`).\n17. **Audit log** (side-effect) \u2014 emits an `AUDIT` info line with id, customerCode, registrationDate, membershipLevel.\n18. **Build response** \u2014 map to `OwnerDto`, set `Location: /api/owners/{id}` header, return **201 Created**.\n\n## Notes worth flagging\n\n- **Entity-level Bean Validation** (`@NotEmpty` on `Owner`/`Person`; `@Pattern ^\\+[0-9]{8,15}$` on `telephone`) is *not* explicitly invoked in this path \u2014 `saveOwner` has no `@Valid`. It would only fire via Hibernate's pre-flush validation, and by then the controller's manual checks have already covered the same ground.\n- **No JPA lifecycle callbacks, entity listeners, or application events** exist anywhere in the create path \u2014 every side-effect is the explicit code above plus the audit log.\n- **Performance side-note:** steps 7, 8, 13, and 15 each independently call `findAllOwners()` (full table scan), so a single create scans all owners several times."
